  "title": "MemToC: Benchmarking Memory-Tool Conflict Resolution in Large Language Models",
  "summary": "MemToC introduces a controlled benchmark for post-tool-return arbitration, measuring the reliability of tool returns in LLMs while establishing source correctness. The framework evaluates 6,504 episodes across 542 factual questions, providing insights into how tool returns influence model performance.",
